commands

pwd current dir
ls
ls -l (details)
ls -a (include hidden files)
rmdir (delete empty dir)

touch filename (create an empty file)
cp sourcefile targetfile (paste file)
mv sourcefile targetfile (move/rename file)
rm (delete file)
rm -r (recurrently delete file and dir)
rm -f (delete with f(force))
rm -rf (delete dir -f)


